  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Using bulk expression and clinical follow-up for 400 lung adenocarcinoma patients, I need a model that predicts each new patient's overall-survival risk, something like a penalized Cox model that outputs a risk score, which I can then lock and apply to an external validation cohort of 150 patients from another hospital without refitting. Ideally the score would also show which genes drive the risk."
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "What I understood you are asking for:\n1. \"I need a model that predicts each new patient's overall-survival risk, something like a penalized Cox model that outputs a risk score, which I can then lock and apply to an external validation cohort of 150 patients from another hospital without refitting.\" -- the backup check matched no registered workflow to this (not confirmed).\n2. \"the score would also show which genes drive the risk.\" -- the backup check matched no registered workflow to this (not confirmed).\nThe usual capability check could not run this turn, so a backup model read the request; the lines above are not confirmed, and the methods below were not removed for them.\n\nAbout \"a model that predicts each new patient's overall-survival risk\": No registered workflow builds a model that predicts an outcome for new samples. Per-sample results -- targeting scores from per-sample networks, GIRAFFE's TF activities, or subtypes -- can serve as features for a classifier you build outside NetZoo, which then needs the outcome for each sample and testing on samples not used to build it.\n\nRouting matched these registered workflows to your words, but the capability check did not confirm that any of them gives what you asked for:\n- **LIONESS-PANDA** — produces: One TF-gene network per sample, plus the aggregate network.\n- **LIONESS-PUMA** — produces: One TF/miRNA-gene network per sample, plus the aggregate network.\n\nCompare what each produces with what you asked for. Ask again to re-run the check, or say which result you want and from which workflow.\n\nNo files were inspected and no analysis ran."
    }
  ],
